<!--
  The app's words in Russian.

  Reviewed by a native speaker before shipping — which is the whole reason the
  app's chrome left the runtime translator on 2026-10-02. A machine translation
  that nobody reads is how "Ответы" shipped with a Greek omicron in it.

  Counted strings use "×%1$s" and "%1$s/%2$s" rather than a noun phrase, so no
  form has to agree with the number: Russian needs three plural forms and
  neither the app nor the reader can choose between them.

  app_name is deliberately absent — a product name is not translated.
-->
